<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 bln French franc 10-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 bln French franc 10-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse de Depots et Consignations and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON   * 5.30	MATURITY ** 27.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.635   PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE, 7.375 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	   ** CALL AT PAR IN YEAR FIVE</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
